From 1928fd03a36fd407ff618f1f52e8b3b1c83ab983 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 03:30:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 29/61] Modern abilities, batch 1: three ability slots and 41
 new abilities

- Species get up to three abilities (two regular + hidden) from modern
  data; the hidden slot is stored in a spare ribbon bit
- 75 later-generation abilities defined; abilities only replace the Gen 3
  ones once implemented (tools/hack/abilities.py IMPLEMENTED list)
- Implemented: Adaptability, Analytic, Big Pecks, Contrary, Dry Skin,
  Filter, Friend Guard, Gluttony, Heavy/Light Metal, Hydration, Ice Body,
  Iron Fist, Magic Guard, Multiscale, No Guard, Normalize, Overcoat, Poison
  Heal, Quick Feet, Reckless, Rivalry, Sand Force, Sand Rush, Scrappy,
  Sheer Force, Simple, Skill Link, Sniper, Snow Cloak, Solar Power, Solid
  Rock, Stall, Super Luck, Tangled Feet, Technician, Telepathy, Tinted Lens,
  Toxic Boost, Unaware, Wonder Skin
- Weather and Flash Fire boosts apply to physical moves too
- The coach can switch to any of a Pokemon's abilities, hidden included
- Guide: hidden abilities in the Pokedex

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
